\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Total corpus $cRV$ as a function of the baseline retained-challenge value $EV_c$, over the range $[0.034, 0.30]$ runs spanning the empirical estimate and the fixed baseline. The relationship is exactly linear because the opportunity-cost penalty applies only to failed challenges and scales linearly in $EV_c$; successful challenges carry no penalty term. Endpoint values are labeled.}}{12}{figure.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:sensitivity}{{4}{12}{Total corpus $cRV$ as a function of the baseline retained-challenge value $EV_c$, over the range $[0.034, 0.30]$ runs spanning the empirical estimate and the fixed baseline. The relationship is exactly linear because the opportunity-cost penalty applies only to failed challenges and scales linearly in $EV_c$; successful challenges carry no penalty term. Endpoint values are labeled}{figure.4}{}}
